      },
      "classification": "finite-example",
      "adaptations": [
        "Retain the literal-bound query, constructor union, 100-round budget, and final equality unchanged.",
        "Validation changes the bound literal to 3; the negative control asks for an unjustified literal after execution."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "The negative control constructs the alternative literal only after the run; it checks absence of a result, not exclusion of an already-populated competing literal.",
        "Finite literal-query conformance only; no general query-planner or performance claim."
      ],
